WEBVTT

00:17:29.696 --> 00:17:31.837
I certainly don't know
how to control talent,

00:17:31.861 --> 00:17:34.530
which I do think has a genetic ...

00:17:34.554 --> 00:17:35.846
It's a lot of luck as well,

00:17:35.870 --> 00:17:39.684
[I was] raised in a family where a lot
of my talents were allowed to be fostered.

00:17:39.708 --> 00:17:40.873
That's very lucky.

00:17:40.897 --> 00:17:44.164
But the only one of those three
that I have absolute control over

00:17:44.188 --> 00:17:45.340
is how hard I work.

00:17:45.364 --> 00:17:48.931
So it seemed to me that it was obvious
that if you want to do this,

00:17:48.955 --> 00:17:52.527
then maximize how much time
you put into the third of it

00:17:52.551 --> 00:17:54.789
that you have any power over.

00:17:54.813 --> 00:17:56.444
The expression that I've coined --

00:17:56.468 --> 00:17:59.329
I don't know if I coined it,
but I say it all the time -- is:

00:17:59.353 --> 00:18:01.551
your labor is the contribution
to the miracle.